# Dynamic map literal construction

Measures repeated construction of a small dynamic map literal followed by one
indexed read. The final read is the only output, so map formatting does not
dominate the timed workload.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {}
let last = 0

for (iteration in 0..50000) {
    values = {
        "first": iteration,
        "second": iteration + 1,
        "third": iteration + 2
    }
    last = values["second"]
}

print(last)
